{"file": "蚀骨罪-第75集.mp4", "ep": 75, "duration": 61.4, "segments": [{"start": 0.24, "end": 2.8, "text": "這容器是蕭大少遣人送來的"}, {"start": 2.8, "end": 4.08, "text": "我也不知道啊"}, {"start": 4.4, "end": 5.08, "text": "沈總"}, {"start": 5.08, "end": 7.24, "text": "我是真不知道這是你的廠子"}, {"start": 7.76, "end": 9.04, "text": "如果這人出了事"}, {"start": 9.44, "end": 10.44, "text": "我賠錢"}, {"start": 17.27, "end": 17.95, "text": "老闆"}, {"start": 17.95, "end": 18.71, "text": "你休息"}, {"start": 18.95, "end": 19.95, "text": "讓我和沈二來"}, {"start": 19.95, "end": 20.67, "text": "沈一"}, {"start": 20.95, "end": 21.95, "text": "一起給我砸"}, {"start": 22.15, "end": 22.75, "text": "沈二"}, {"start": 22.75, "end": 24.35, "text": "打電話叫白衣行立刻來"}, {"start": 24.35, "end": 25.19, "text": "沈三"}, {"start": 25.19, "end": 27.11, "text": "出去把人都叫過來給我砸"}, {"start": 27.11, "end": 27.91, "text": "沈總"}, {"start": 27.91, "end": 28.63, "text": "何必"}, {"start": 28.63, "end": 29.91, "text": "找一個雷岩"}, {"start": 29.91, "end": 30.67, "text": "杜立群"}, {"start": 31.03, "end": 32.43, "text": "我的人你敢這麼玩"}, {"start": 32.83, "end": 34.11, "text": "我看你是找死"}, {"start": 34.74, "end": 36.5, "text": "你最好祈禱他沒事"}, {"start": 36.5, "end": 37.62, "text": "否則"}, {"start": 37.62, "end": 39.3, "text": "你就永遠留在延遲吧"}, {"start": 39.9, "end": 40.9, "text": "老闆"}, {"start": 40.9, "end": 42.5, "text": "你的手會廢"}, {"start": 42.5, "end": 43.5, "text": "退開"}, {"start": 44.1, "end": 51.42, "text": "是沈總的"}, {"start": 51.93, "end": 53.09, "text": "他為了剪頭"}, {"start": 53.09, "end": 54.01, "text": "剪頭"}, {"start": 54.01, "end": 54.73, "text": "呼吸"}, {"start": 54.73, "end": 55.77, "text": "給我呼吸"}]}